From cd679436f4ca37b17584775169a8a6631399087a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 21:10:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/98] fix: address code review issues across feishu,
 cli-runner, and security modules

- Extract duplicate monitor utilities (asNonEmptyString, asRecord, etc.) into monitor.utils.ts
- Extract duplicate media type constants into media-types.ts
- Fix streaming-card sequence gap: only commit sequence on success
- Fix compaction pseudo-profile fragility: separate compaction step from profile loop
- Upgrade allowReadOutsideWorkspace log from debug to warn for security visibility
- Move const log below imports in cli-runner/helpers.ts
- Remove fragile "no user authority" string match fallback in bot.ts
- Remove unused rawContent field from SendMediaResult
- Fix TS type errors in test files (bot.test, quoted-message.test, cli-runner.test, streaming-card.test)
- Add skillstore-plugin-publisher to .gitignore

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
